---
args: {"segment": "EvidencePage", "authority": "PolicyCandidate[]"}
returns: "AttributedAct[]"
---
Distinguish proposing, assenting, objecting, formally adopting, and correcting an earlier record. Resolve authority only for that speaker's actual act, scope and effective date. A collective statement needs attributable acceptance under the supplied rule. Preserve a late correction's recording date separately from the date of the corrected meeting. Mark unknown speaker, time or authority instead of supplying a convenient default.
